# Whitelist: the build context only needs the service directories and the
# static config examples from the concentratord submodule. Everything else
# (especially the chirpstack-gateway-os/openwrt tree) must stay out of the
# upload to the balena builders.
*
!docker-compose.yml
!concentratord
!mqtt-forwarder
!chirpstack-concentratord
chirpstack-concentratord/.git
chirpstack-concentratord/target
